{"id":"vod_hh_175847","vodId":"175847","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"皇家国教骑士团","name_cn":"皇家国教骑士团","date":"2001-01-01","year":"2001","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第13集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/313ea2d1af614f71021dd0c5f149c6e2.jpg"},"summary":"在英国某个村庄，吸血鬼和食尸鬼横行霸道，祸害人间。旨在消灭反基督怪物的皇家国教骑士团（Hellsing）派出强大、恐怖的吸血鬼杀手阿尔卡特，阿尔卡特打败邪物，也间接将倒霉的女警察西洛斯·维多利亚变成吸血鬼，进而成为Hellsing的一员。此后不久，Hellsing总部遭到近乎毁灭性的入侵，随着各种离奇事件层出不穷，一个名为“千禧年”的邪恶组织慢慢浮出水面。他们全由纳粹战败军官组成，为了一雪二战之耻，这群战争狂人不惜制造一支吸血鬼军团。搅合了多方势力的正邪大战就此拉开序幕……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-08-13 14:48:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bmZyqxEd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/egJ2p4Zd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e31w6D4b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eERxqoma/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e9rg9Z8a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dNk0OAme/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bW6qPN4a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/axk164ze/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e5yL7pqe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bo2yZ4Aa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bYE57AOb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dPNQjoya/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集完结","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dJ6Q8g9d/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:57.979Z"}